# RETIRED 2026-09-07 (s2b/s2c out of scope): A20 | train | s2c | vision_chronos2_s2c        | 42       | uk_pv_s1_selfattn_s{seed}
# RETIRED 2026-09-07 (s2b/s2c out of scope): A28 | train | s2c | vision_chronos2_s2c        | 42       | uk_pv_s1_selfattn_s{seed}
